    {
      "text": "01  CORE IDEA &amp; ALGORITHM",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 775,
      "width": 1548.7874015748034,
      "height": 66.42,
      "font_size": 54,
      "alignment": "left"
    },
    {
      "text": "<b>From average importance to worst-case evidence.</b><br/>A harmful coalition witness: adding a feature turns v = 1 into 0.",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 885,
      "width": 1548.7874015748034,
      "height": 110,
      "font_size": 42,
      "alignment": "left"
    },
    {
      "text": "v<sub>α</sub>(S) = 1[U<sub>val</sub>(S) ≥ α U<sub>val</sub>(N)]",
      "x": 132,
      "y": 1058,
      "width": 1484.7874015748034,
      "height": 65,
      "font_size": 50,
      "alignment": "left"
    },
    {
      "text": "MinPI<sub>i</sub> = min [v<sub>α</sub>(S <font name=\"PosterMath\">∪</font> {i}) - v<sub>α</sub>(S)]",
      "x": 132,
      "y": 1143,
      "width": 1484.7874015748034,
      "height": 65,
      "font_size": 50,
      "alignment": "left"
    },
    {
      "text": "over S <font name=\"PosterMath\">⊆</font> N <font name=\"PosterMath\">∖</font> {i}; N = analyzed features",
      "x": 132,
      "y": 1218,
      "width": 1484.7874015748034,
      "height": 43.05,
      "font_size": 35,
      "alignment": "left"
    },
    {
      "text": "ALGORITHM FLOW",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 1308,
      "width": 1548.7874015748034,
      "height": 44.28,
      "font_size": 36,
      "alignment": "left"
    },
    {
      "text": "1",
      "x": 119,
      "y": 1398,
      "width": 58,
      "height": 37,
      "font_size": 30,
      "alignment": "center"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prepare the game",
      "x": 195,
      "y": 1392,
      "width": 1423.7874015748034,
      "height": 51.66,
      "font_size": 42,
      "alignment": "left"
    },
    {
      "text": "Split 64% / 16% / 20% into train / validation / test.<br/>Fit coalition models on train; evaluate the game on validation.",
      "x": 132,
      "y": 1458,
      "width": 1484.7874015748034,
      "height": 90,
      "font_size": 36,
      "alignment": "left"
    },
    {
      "text": "2",
      "x": 119,
      "y": 1612,
      "width": 58,
      "height": 37,
      "font_size": 30,
      "alignment": "center"
    },
    {
      "text": "Estimate MinPI &amp; collect witnesses",
      "x": 195,
      "y": 1606,
      "width": 1423.7874015748034,
      "height": 51.66,
      "font_size": 42,
      "alignment": "left"
    },
    {
      "text": "<b>A:</b> sample coalition size, then a subset, uniformly.<br/><b>B:</b> perturb a training-only MI-correlation seed<br/>(drop each member with p = 0.3; add 0-5 features).<br/>Take the minimum observed marginal; H = features with estimate -1.",
      "x": 132,
      "y": 1672,
      "width": 1484.7874015748034,
      "height": 176,
      "font_size": 35,
      "alignment": "left"
    },
    {
      "text": "n ≤ 20: exact  |  20 &lt; n ≤ 75: B*  |  n &gt; 75: min(A, B)",
      "x": 132,
      "y": 1867,
      "width": 1484.7874015748034,
      "height": 39.36,
      "font_size": 32,
      "alignment": "left"
    },
    {
      "text": "*Use A if correlation neighbors are unavailable; n = |N|.",
      "x": 132,
      "y": 1912,
      "width": 1484.7874015748034,
      "height": 38.13,
      "font_size": 31,
      "alignment": "left"
    },
    {
      "text": "3",
      "x": 119,
      "y": 2010,
      "width": 58,
      "height": 37,
      "font_size": 30,
      "alignment": "center"
    },
    {
      "text": "Validate joint removal",
      "x": 195,
      "y": 2004,
      "width": 1423.7874015748034,
      "height": 51.66,
      "font_size": 42,
      "alignment": "left"
    },
    {
      "text": "U<sub>val</sub>(N <font name=\"PosterMath\">∖</font> H) ≥ U<sub>val</sub>(N) - ε",
      "x": 132,
      "y": 2070,
      "width": 1484.7874015748034,
      "height": 63,
      "font_size": 50,
      "alignment": "left"
    },
    {
      "text": "ε = 0.005 (classification); 0.01 (regression).",
      "x": 132,
      "y": 2139,
      "width": 1484.7874015748034,
      "height": 44.28,
      "font_size": 36,
      "alignment": "left"
    },
    {
      "text": "<b>PASS:</b> remove all H.  <b>FAIL:</b> keep all features.",
      "x": 132,
      "y": 2190,
      "width": 1484.7874015748034,
      "height": 43.05,
      "font_size": 35,
      "alignment": "left"
    },
    {
      "text": "4",
      "x": 119,
      "y": 2294,
      "width": 58,
      "height": 37,
      "font_size": 30,
      "alignment": "center"
    },
    {
      "text": "Evaluate (optional NSGA-II search)",
      "x": 195,
      "y": 2288,
      "width": 1423.7874015748034,
      "height": 51.66,
      "font_size": 42,
      "alignment": "left"
    },
    {
      "text": "Select on validation; optionally run MinPI-prefiltered NSGA-II.<br/>Finally report held-out utility and feature compression.",
      "x": 132,
      "y": 2354,
      "width": 1484.7874015748034,
      "height": 90,
      "font_size": 36,
      "alignment": "left"
    },
    {
      "text": "02  RESULTS &amp; EVIDENCE",
